 C/AD:,NAME,DTRAN  /01.06.84/    . Advance the file buffer iterator
C===========================================================
C C/AD - advance buffer iterator (the [M1+35B]/[M1+36B] cache).
C  Called from C/CO, C/GF's text path, C/RF and C/TF to step
C  the FILE[7] WTC operand by one element.  Uses [M1+35B] as
C  the previous-FILE[7] snapshot and [M1+36B] as a copy of it.
C  Returns through M14; FILE[7] = 0 returns at once.
C
C  Labelled ADVANCE in p_sys.asm.
C===========================================================
C Register convention (see FILE.md):
C   M12 = base of the FILE record being acted on
C   M1  = runtime constant table ([M1+8] = 1U, [M1+9] = integer-tag
C         mask, [M1+12] = positive-mantissa mask, [M1+25B] = MSB;
C         [M1+3..5] and [M1+35B..37B] are runtime scratch)
C   M13 = link register set by the calling VJM
C   M14 = secondary link (used inside packed-mode helpers)
 12,XTA,7                    . ACC := FILE[7]
 14,UZA,                     . FILE[7]=0 -> return via M14
 1,AEX,35B                   . compare to [M1+29] cache
 ,U1A,SLOWPATH               . changed -> slow path
 12,WTC,7                    . WT := FILE[7]
 ,XTA,                       . ACC := mem[WT]
 1,ATX,35B                   . refresh [M1+29] := new value
 ,UJ,STORECUR
 SLOWPATH:1,XTA,35B          . pull cached value
 15,ATX,1                    . save on stack
 SCANLOOP:15,WTC,1           . loop scanning ahead
 ,XTA,
 12,AEX,7
 ,UZA,RELINK
 15,WTC,1
 ,XTA,
 15,ATX,1
 ,UJ,SCANLOOP
 RELINK:12,WTC,7
 ,XTA,
 15,WTC,1
 ,ATX,                       . write new buffer slot
 STORECUR:1,XTA,36B          . ACC := [M1+30] (working ptr)
 12,WTC,7
 ,ATX,
 12,XTA,7
 1,ATX,36B                   . refresh [M1+30] := FILE[7]
 ,XTA,
 12,ATX,7                    . FILE[7] := 0 (consumed)
 14,UJ,                      . return via M14
 ,END,
